# api/src/main/resources/mappings/<version>.json is the API's contract and is committed. The updater's diagnostics (analysis.json, repair
# bundles) go to ~/.kraken-native/cache/<sha256>/, outside the repo.

# Client binaries and Ghidra models live outside the repo (~/.kraken-native); never commit them
*.exe
*.dll

